  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1/  The proposed vehicle crossover serving the front garden of the house, \r\n            would by reason of  existing facilities for off street parking at the rear \r\n            of the property,  lead to unnecessary parking at the front, prejudicial to \r\n            the free flow of traffic and is contrary to the Policies ENV B 1.1( New \r\n            Development) and T5.3 (Vehicle Crossovers and Hardstandings)\r\n\t T4.4 (Road Safety) of the Unitary Development Plan.\r\n\r\n        2/ The proposed vehicle crossover, would by reason of  its      \r\n            position, involve the excavation and loss of part of the grass verge and    \r\n            would be visually out of character and obtrusive to neighbouring \r\n            residential properties and detrimental to the visual amenities of the \r\n            street scene and is contrary to the Policies ENVB1.1 (New \r\n            Development)  of the Unitary Development Plan.\r\n"
